Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.68,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,WHITE RABBIT: Oh\, dear! Oh\, dear! I shall be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:14.19,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: A rabbit wearing a waistcoat and carrying a watch? How curious! Oh wait! Mr. Rabbit! Where are you going? What's the hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:17.26,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,WHITE RABBIT: The Queen will be furious if I don't reach the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:23.48,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: Welcome to Wonderland\, little girl! Looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.43,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: I'm looking for my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:29.94,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: That depends on where you want to go! We're all mad here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:32.69,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Everybody seems so strange here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:35.12,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: Follow the music to the tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:40.62,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Twinkle\, twinkle\, little bat...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:44.63,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MAD HATTER: No room! No room! Welcome to our tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:46.58,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: But there's plenty of room!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:50.69,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MARCH HARE: Have some tea! Or perhaps some imaginary wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.36,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Why is this tea party so strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:56.91,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MAD HATTER: Because in Wonderland\, nothing makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:01.42,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Please stop! I'm trying to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.21,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Don't you ever wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:06.44,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Only when someone mentions cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:08.87,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MARCH HARE: Wake up\, Dormouse! It's tea time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:11.46,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Oh! Then I'm wide awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:18.00,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: Who dares enter my garden? Off with their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:19.71,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Why are you so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:22.46,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: How dare you question the Queen of Hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.81,0:01:26.73,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Yes\, Your Majesty! Nobody questions the Queen of Hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:29.64,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Do you always follow orders without thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.99,0:01:32.15,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Well\, I'm a soldier\, not a thinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:35.14,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: Enough talking! Seize her immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:37.01,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Yes\, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:41.36,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: I'm not afraid of you! You're nothing but a pack of cards!